    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for saying that, but it doesn't change the reality. even if you say it's valid, it still feels so empty. it's like there's this massive gap between me and the rest of the world. if i'm just a ghost drifting around, is there actually any reason to keep struggling so hard just to exist? it feels like i'm fighting for something that isn't even there.",
